sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant UI
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Graph as LangGraph
  participant Profile
  participant Memory
  participant LLM
  User->>UI: 输入消息
  UI->>API: POST /chat
  API->>Graph: invoke
  Graph->>Profile: load_profile(user_id)
  Profile-->>Graph: profile snapshot
  Graph->>Memory: retrieve(query, user_id)
  Memory-->>Graph: relevant memories
  Graph->>Graph: build personalized context
  Graph->>LLM: prompt + user request
  LLM-->>Graph: response
  Graph-->>API: final response
  API-->>UI: HTTP response
  UI-->>User: 展示回答
  API-->>Memory: enqueue memory update (async)
